{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|01264126471FFA52D3DE3BB0DDF6BBE9", "source_en": "Securing MY victory Solomon!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "سأضمنُ انتصاري يا سولومون!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|1578F69444C2F73C00B4C994509DD4D4", "source_en": "You’ve done well by me Nephilim.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "لقد أثبتَّ جدارتكَ أمامي يا نيفيليم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|178A0F7143EF8EFEB1E8CE98476C62AA", "source_en": "The Eye of the Abyss... is mine... to behold.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "عينُ الهاوية... ملكي... لأتأملها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|219E740D499D29549673E5A93D3C5CAE", "source_en": "This again?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "هذا مجددًا؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|2216005F41AD173E54D4D48E310A97B8", "source_en": "Your brothers await you in the garden.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "إخوتُكَ ينتظرونكَ في الحديقة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|304A6B954B405319DB89F6BA18A4A95A", "source_en": "Your coffin calls, Nephilim.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "تابوتُكَ يناديكَ، يا نيفيليم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|3171186847723F99C52B1B8EEDD4FF4F", "source_en": "The Garden beckons.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "الحديقة تناديك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|34E68BFB4F4EB0722F55349F0DBCCFD6", "source_en": "Solomon will have to forgive me, but I can wait no longer.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "سيتعين على سولومون أن يغفر لي، لكنني لا أستطيع الانتظار أكثر.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|46BE58E4463367BFAE2BB99E0BD897AE", "source_en": "You're nothing without your angel!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "أنت لا شيء بدون ملاكك!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|4AD9C45447ABFBD62FB69783818BCB3D", "source_en": "Persistent as always.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "لا تزال عنيداً كالعادة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|526152A34C4E6EAA4B264FA5B2328059", "source_en": "You will be worn, its only a matter of time.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "ستنهك قواك، إنها مسألة وقت ليس إلا.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|55AB667E4124314FAACDCEAEDC1D3612", "source_en": "I wield the dead gods, you've no hope against me!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "أنا سيد الآلهة الميتة، لا أمل لك في مواجهتي!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|5D46C82646B4DA0BEDD46E9BEC6E9AAF", "source_en": "This should be good.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "سيكون هذا جيداً.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|5DEE675842BAEC2518FE33BC539634C2", "source_en": "Viscera, fertile ground for the Legion’s occupation and my ascension", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "الأحشاء، أرض خصبة لاحتلال الفيلق وارتقائي.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|64A56F274DBF293C5A6242AE2D7FF29F", "source_en": "were stronger than we could have anticipated, and thus deviation is... necessary.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "كانت أقوى مما توقعنا، ولذا فإن الانحراف... ضروري.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|6EA6BF3F499C6FE4CEA11CB76FF31EE0", "source_en": "Let the Red Bloom take you.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "ليدع الإزهار الأحمر يختطفك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|99A103774A0EFE6AF61BDAB86269BEB0", "source_en": "Every foe fell by your blade, courses through my veins.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "كل عدو سقط بنصلك، يتدفق الآن في عروقي.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|A9225F9D4732B0AF49146B85F5328951", "source_en": "I’ll seal that coffin of yours beneath a forest of flesh and bone.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "سأختم تابوتك تحت غابة من اللحم والعظام.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|AEDEAB954E8801BA5EC9729C3EEA0E24", "source_en": "The souls of the Fallen, are prisoners within my mind.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "أرواح الساقطين سجينةٌ في عقلي.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|BB4576814797B318974986AF0650582F", "source_en": "I accept your sacrifice.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "أقبلُ تضحيتك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|BB903E074A3150B061122DAF5FE87221", "source_en": "But you...", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "ولكنك أنت...", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|BD4450BE4D5A38F4C35122A0BE1B1544", "source_en": "More viscera for the Bloom. Give in!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "المزيد من الأحشاء من أجل الإزهار. استسلم!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|CE24F61B4C1859F9BDF0259323A1A381", "source_en": "Kneel Nephilim, before the new Lord of Akyreon!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "اركع يا نيفيليم، أمام سيد أكيريون الجديد!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|D228774F497326B0319E87A8846EDBC0", "source_en": "Let the madness take you, Nephilim.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "دع الجنون يختطفك، يا نيفيليم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|D4D11A4B4A11FCD323D163B8EB35048A", "source_en": "Your soul shall make a fine addition to my Garden.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "ستكون روحك إضافةً جيدةً لحديقتي.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|DF86F0814E15A03A8C57198A15B6BFC1", "source_en": "The city, Mathias, the Egregore, myself. Now carrion for the Garden.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "المدينة، وماثياس، والإيغريغور، وأنا. الآن، جميعنا جيفٌ للحديقة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|E42C4E2B428B5695C40F4C88DFDA0643", "source_en": "Amusing display.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "عرضٌ مسلٍ.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|E6091C534E22BBA387B2ADA5B3BD00AE", "source_en": "The power of the dead gods, are mine to wield.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "قوة الآلهة الميتة، ملكي وحدي لأطوعها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TA|FF883ED64805F67EE8256985DD2363F7", "source_en": "You are weary of this world. Join the Garden, Aether Spawn!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TA", "ar": "لقد سئمتَ من هذا العالم. انضم إلى الحديقة، يا سليل الأثير!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 1}}
